SRR17063412	PRJNA784440	SRP348371	SAMN23489560	SRX13252250	Homo sapiens	Persisters 3 [gT3]	Persisters 3 [gT3]	Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM5706923: Persisters 3 [gT3] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina NovaSeq 6000	RNA samples were extracted using Qiagen RNeasy Plus kit (QIAGEN) Library construction and RNA sequencing were performed by Novogene as a service. Briefly, ribosomal RNA was removed from total RNA by rRNA removal kit, and rRNA free residue was cleaned up by ethanol precipitation. After fragmentation, the first strand cDNA was synthesized using random hexamer primers. Then the second strand cDNA was synthesized and dUTPs were replaced with dTTPs in the reaction buffer. The directional library was ready after end repair, A-tailing, adapter ligation, size selection, USER enzyme digestion, amplification, and purification.	42668156	12800446800	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR170/012/SRR17063412/SRR17063412_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR170/012/SRR17063412/SRR17063412_2.fastq.gz	4fcf326fe8aebf72b663dcbdca7ee3fc;571d27a417152d428000045f8ad8a62a	3058028883;3125809497
